    "text": "By Zoe Strothers Katie Coen ,\n1 hours ago HARTFORD, Conn. (WFSB) - A woman in her 40s was killed and another woman was injured in a double shooting in Hartford. The woman in her 40s was found dead on scene in a car, according to police. A woman in her 30s was found on the sidewalk and taken to a hospital with not life-threatening injuries. Read full article",
